/* ============================================================================
/* IEEE 25-Bus Network  --  Monitored Elements (.mon)
/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/* TARA-format monitor file. Defines the branch flows and bus voltages checked
/* for the base case and for every contingency in ieee_25bus.con.
/* Requires the subsystem definitions in ieee_25bus.sub
/* ============================================================================

/* --- BRANCH THERMAL MONITORING ---

MONITOR BRANCHES IN SYSTEM 'MonSys'
MONITOR TIES FROM SYSTEM 'SouthSys' KVRANGE 138 230

/* --- INTERFACE MONITORING ---
/* South (138 kV) to Mid (230 kV) transformer interface.

Monitor interface 'South_to_Mid' Rating 2000
 Monitor branch from bus 103 to bus 224 ckt 1
 Monitor branch from bus 109 to bus 211 ckt 1
 Monitor branch from bus 109 to bus 212 ckt 1
 Monitor branch from bus 110 to bus 211 ckt 1
 Monitor branch from bus 110 to bus 212 ckt 1
End

/* --- VOLTAGE MAGNITUDE MONITORING ---
/*             area  kvrange lo  hi   normalLo normalHi  emergLo emergHi

monitor voltage range area 1 kvrange 138 138  0.95 1.05  0.90 1.10
monitor voltage range area 2 kvrange 138 138  0.95 1.05  0.90 1.10
monitor voltage range area 5 kvrange 138 138  0.95 1.05  0.90 1.10
monitor voltage range area 3 kvrange 230 230  0.95 1.05  0.90 1.10
monitor voltage range area 4 kvrange 230 230  0.95 1.05  0.90 1.10

/* --- VOLTAGE DEVIATION MONITORING ---
/* Flag any bus whose voltage moves more than 0.05 pu from the base case.

monitor voltage deviation in system 'MonSys' 0.05 0.05
